    "title": "Lupe Fiasco to headline Shocker Madness - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Carina Branson ,\n1 days ago WICHITA, Kan. (KSNW) – Wichita State University announced Tuesday that Grammy Award-winning rapper Lupe Fiasco will headline Shocker Madness as part of Shocktoberfest. Fiasco is best known for hits such as “The Show Goes On,” “Superstar,” and “Battle Scars“. Shocker Madness showcases this... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
